WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.571
- WHERE IS HE?

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:09.142
- STANLEY.
- HUH?

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.543
- WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.345
- OH, COME ON, I KNOW
YOU'VE BEEN CHEATING ON ME.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:13.579
- YOU'RE BEING RIDICULOUS.

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:16.382
- ANDREA, ENOUGH IS ENOUGH.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:20.486
I KNOW YOU HAVE BEEN [bleep]
A DOG BEHIND MY BACK.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.422
- WHAT?

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.457
A DOG?
A DOG?

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.591
THAT IS INSANE.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.595
- THEN WHY DID I FIND THIS
IN THE LAUNDRY ROOM, HUH?

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:31.764
[dog barks in the distance]

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:34.500
OH, MY GOD,
HE'S HERE RIGHT NOW, ISN'T HE?

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:37.136
HE'S IN MY HOUSE RIGHT NOW!

00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:38.404
- WAIT, STANLEY, NO!
WAIT!

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:41.674
[growling]

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.810
- IT WAS YOU!

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.844
[screaming and struggling]

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:46.212
- [gasps]

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:47.580
- YOU S--OW!
WHAT HA--

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:48.581
AAH!
[dog yipping]

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:50.817
[growling]

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.752
- [exclaiming]

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:55.188
- AAH!

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.424
[screaming]

00:00:58.457 --> 00:00:59.425
[dog growling]

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:01.694
[grunting]

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:04.831
- [mouthing inaudibly]
GO.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.573
- COME HERE.

00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:27.386
OH.

00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:28.788
I SEE.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.328
YOU...

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.397
NEED TO KNOW...

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:42.135
YOUR DOG RUINED
A TEN-YEAR MARRIAGE.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:46.806
[dog whimpers]

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.741
AND YOU CAN GO TO HELL.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.418
NO, HE'S CUTE, HE'S CUTE.
I CAN SEE WHY YOU LIKE HIM.

